text = "[b]Goal:[/b]
Survive in the Wasteland while managing Energy, Food, Equipment, Sanity, and Radiation!

[b]Vague Indicators:[/b]
Indicators display qualitative status (LOW, MEDIUM, HIGH, SAFE, DANGER). Buy Exact Insight in the Shop to unlock exact numbers!

[b]Doom History:[/b]
If you collapse, experience 2 cards showing how you met your doom before seeing your final score!"

